  "description": "A schema-driven form engine for Blazor: render forms from C# types, a fluent builder or JSON Schema, with validation, conditional visibility, requiredness and read-only state, computed values, cascading options, multi-step wizards and array/repeater fields. Every decision runs in C#; the renderers are plain, accessible HTML with a pluggable renderer registry and a themeable stylesheet.",
